---

Mix together the @masa harina{2%cups}, @water{160%mls} and @salt{1%teaspoon} until you create dough.

Divide the dough into 8 balls (50g/2 ounces each).

Heat a #skillet with @oil{1%tablespoon} over medium-high heat. Flatten the balls of dough between two sheets of #plastic wrap{} with something heavy until it is around 0.5cm thick.

Place the gordita dough on the #skillet and let it cook on each side for ~{15%seconds}. Once each side gets a slight color, cook each side for ~{2%minutes} until it gets dark spots. Place it on the #plate and cover it with a #towel.

Once you cook them all, using the #knife, cut them in half, making a pocket on the bottom side. Add your favorite fillings.